text:
@Sagar Sinha: - Bhai, ttheek-ttheek bataao ki kab tak sudhar jaaoge aap?

Aap apne reviews aur video ki popularity batorne ke liye kuchh bhi content banaaoge kya? Agar aisa hi hai to kyon comment mein TERM-INSURANCE bech rahe ho bhai?

Aapke channel se ab unsubscribe karna padega. Genuine and Real cheez dikhaao na aur fact baat bataao aap.
